===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|чета||troop, multitude, community}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*četa}}, akin to Czech {{m|cs|četa||platoon, squad}}, Serbo-Croatian {{m|sh|чета}}, Bulgarian {{m|bg|чета}},  possibly Latin {{m|la|caterva}}.

